1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,020
MENDAKI is introducing

2
00:00:01,020 --> 00:00:01,840
the Ready for School

3
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:03,060
e-voucher initiative

4
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:04,360
which we hope to help kids

5
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:05,100
from Primary One

6
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,440
all the way up to university.

7
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:08,760
So, as we begin the school year

8
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,060
as you know, for many parents

9
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:10,840
it's also a time where

10
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:11,400
there are a lot of

11
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,260
expenses for school

12
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:13,040
and we want our kids

13
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:14,920
to have the best start in life.

14
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:15,460
You have things like

15
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:17,240
schoolbooks, textbooks, uniforms

16
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:18,160
and other expenses

17
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:20,020
that parents have to fork out.

18
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:20,960
And during these times

19
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:21,700
especially when you have

20
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,240
cost of living concerns

21
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:24,120
challenging times

22
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:25,060
we want to help parents

23
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:25,780
from low-income families

24
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:26,520
to support their kids.

25
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:27,540
This year, MENDAKI

26
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:29,140
is giving out $250 e-vouchers

27
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,440
that parents can use

28
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:31,560
for their children

29
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,200
whether it's schoolbooks

30
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,340
whether it is stationery

31
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:35,820
or even shoes.

32
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:36,840
We are pegging it at about

33
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:38,180
$1,000 per capita income

34
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:38,860
and below.

35
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:40,040
So we expect more than

36
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:41,520
22,000 students

37
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:43,020
who could benefit from this.

38
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:43,980
So it's an application basis

39
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:44,740
and we start to take

40
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:46,160
applications from 1st December.

41
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:47,100
So we hope that this

42
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,360
will do its part

43
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:50,060
to help parents and children

44
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:51,500
have a good start for the year

45
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:52,320
and not to worry

46
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:53,500
about some of these expenses

47
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:54,360
that would have otherwise

48
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:56,120
held them back.
